    Show selected CA cert in task name.
    
    Include the resolved kerbside_ca_cert variable in the
    Ansible task name so the play output shows which CA
    certificate was selected by the first_found lookup.
    
    Prompt: With the highlighted ansible task is there a nice
    way to emit a debug message specifying which cert was
    selected as the value for kerbside_ca_cert without
    re-writing into more than one task?
    
